@startuml delete-manager-company-pk
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title DELETE /api/manager/v1/company/{pk}
caption CRB-68 · 회사 삭제 (고른 현업자가 없을 때만. 있으면 병합으로 처리)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ParseCompanyPkPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminCompanyController" as Controller
participant "AdminCompanyService" as Service
participant "AdminCompanyRepository" as AdminCompanyRepository
participant "AdminAuditLogRepository" as AdminAuditLogRepository
participant "FileService" as FileService
database PostgreSQL
participant "S3"

Client -> Guard: DELETE /api/manager/v1/company/{pk}\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pk 가 1~2147483647 정수가 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 pk must be a positive integer.
end
Pipe -> Controller: remove(pk, manager)
Controller -> Service: remove(pk, manager)

group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: findByPkForUpdate(pk, tx)
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT company_alias WHERE pk = ? FOR UPDATE
  note right
    현업자 프로필 저장의 FOR KEY SHARE 와 직렬화.
    삭제 중 이 회사를 고른 저장은 커밋 뒤 404 Company not found
  end note
  alt 회사 없음
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Company not found
  end
  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: countProfiles(pk, tx)
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) FROM graduated_profile WHERE company_alias_pk = ?
  alt 고른 현업자가 있음 (탈퇴 · 유예기간 포함)
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 409 Company in use. Merge it into another company instead
  end
  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: deleteAlias(pk, tx)
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE company_name WHERE alias_pk = ?\nDELETE company_alias WHERE pk = ?
  note right: FK 는 NO ACTION. 표기를 먼저 지움
  Service -> AdminAuditLogRepository: insert({ adminEmail, action: "company.delete", targetType: "company", targetId: pk,\nbefore: { name, needs_review, logo_key, names } }, tx)
  AdminAuditLogRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT admin_audit_log
  note right: CRB-81 · flow/admin-audit.puml. 기록이 실패하면 변경도 rollback. 변경 전 · 후 값은 회사 이름 · 표기 · 로고 key만 (현업자 정보 제외)
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL: 트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답

opt 로고가 있었음
  Service -> FileService: deleteFileQuietly(logo_key)
  FileService -> S3: DeleteObject
  note right: 커밋 뒤에 지움. 실패하면 로그만 (OrphanFileService 가 나중에 정리)
end

Service --> Controller: (void)
Controller --> Client: 200 { result: "OK" }

@enduml
